#: data/scripts/gift_battle_card.inc:26
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftBattleCountCard"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"Your BATTLE COUNT CARD keeps\n"
"track of your battle record against\l"
"TRAINERS with the same CARD.\p"
"Look for and battle TRAINERS who\n"
"have the same CARD as you.\p"
"You may check the overall rankings\n"
"by reading the NEWS.\p"
"Please do give it a try!$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"你的对战计数卡会记录\n"
"你和持有相同卡片的\l"
"训练家之间的对战成绩。\p"
"去找持有和你相同卡片的\n"
"训练家对战吧。\p"
"阅读新闻就可以\n"
"查看总排名。\p"
"请务必试一试！$"

#: data/scripts/gift_battle_card.inc:38
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftBattleCountCard_WonPrize"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"Congratulations!\p"
"You have won a prize for winning\n"
"three battles!\p"
"We hope you will be inspired to\n"
"battle some more.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"恭喜你！\p"
"你赢得了3场对战，\n"
"获得了奖品！\p"
"希望你能继续\n"
"多多对战。$"
